<title>POLAND: Polish ZEW sets minimum issue price at PLN 38.</title>
<headline>Polish ZEW sets minimum issue price at PLN 38.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish electrodes maker Zaklady Elektrod Weglowych SA set the minimum issue price of its 800,000 IPO at 38 zlotys per share, the firm said in a newspaper announcement.</p>
<p>The company, which seeks the main market listing, plans to offer the shares on February 10-18.</p>
<p>The company also said it had a net profit of 1.4 million zlotys on 153.9-million-zloty sales last year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
